OL,3,GNEWSA'Inspirational' FTD brothers given
OL,4,Afreedom of town
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo brothers who have raised more than
OL,7,F#2m for dementia research through a
OL,8,Fmonth-long series of marathons have
OL,9,Fbeen awarded the freedom of their
OL,10,Fhometown in Worcestershire.
OL,12,FJordan and Cian Adams, known as the FTD
OL,13,Fbrothers, were granted the Freedom of
OL,14,FRedditch in a special gathering at the
OL,15,Ftown's Palace Theatre on Wednesday.
OL,17,FSpeaking in front of friends and
OL,18,Ffamily, Jordan said they had been
OL,19,F"overwhelmed by love and support" and
OL,20,Fcalled it an "honour".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
