OL,3,GNEWSA'Inspirational' FTD brothers given
OL,4,Afreedom of town
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeader of the council, Matt Dormer,
OL,7,Fsaid the brothers had shown
OL,8,F"extraordinary courage, determination
OL,9,Fand selflessness, inspiring people,
OL,10,Facross our borough and beyond, while
OL,11,Fbringing immense pride to Redditch".
